{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2851,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.nevek20.sptmodmanager",
  "name": "SPT Mod Manager",
  "slug": "spt-mod-manager",
  "teaser": "Open-source mod manager for SPT featuring easy installation, management and Forge integration.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/vrJPEuHFoXvwoCAoMn5Zzo9JM3ekLGPqfjOjeZ4a.png",
  "downloads": 1457,
  "favourites_count": 7,
  "description": "<h2>SPT Mod Manager</h2>\n<p>A Vortex/MO2-style mod manager built specifically for Single Player Tarkov. It came out of a real pain point: I got tired of having to hunt down files one by one just to uninstall a mod that was causing conflicts, so I decided to build a tool that would solve that for good.</p>\n<h3>What it does</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Installs <code>.zip</code>, <code>.7z</code>, and <code>.rar</code> mods with automatic structure detection (Server, Client, or Hybrid)</li>\n<li>Enable/disable mods without deleting anything</li>\n<li>Rename, uninstall, and reinstall mods (reinstall works if you still have the original archive)</li>\n<li>Export and import mod lists</li>\n<li>Conflict detection by name (still basic, but improving)</li>\n<li>Forge integration: browse and install mods directly from the app, view mod info, download the right version, and check for updates</li>\n<li>Bilingual UI (PT-BR and EN)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Download the <code>.zip</code>, run the <code>.exe</code>. It installs everything automatically and creates a desktop shortcut.</p>\n<h3>Current limitations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Only tested with compressed archives (no folder-based installs yet)</li>\n<li>Doesn’t modify any SPT core files (only copies/organizes)</li>\n<li>Fully tested and supported only on the latest SPT version (older versions should work, but without guarantees)</li>\n<li>Windows only for now (Linux/macOS support planned, but i need to refine the Mod Manager first)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Personal project, not affiliated with the SPT team or Battlestate Games.</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2851/spt-mod-manager",
  "fika_compatibility": true,
  "featured": false,
  "contains_ads": false,
  "contains_ai_content": true,
  "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>AI tools were used extensively throughout this project’s development, including analyzing code and debugging portions of the codebase, and helping structure parts of the application. The overall design, feature decisions, and testing were done by me, with AI acting as a coding assistant throughout the process.</p>\n",
