      "description": "<p>Release 0.4.2</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed installing certain mods overwriting SPT’s core files, which left the game unable to start.</li>\n<li>Update checks are much faster after the first one, and you can now update straight from the app.</li>\n<li>Mods that ship a DLL plus a data folder no longer appear twice, and more mods now show their version and author.</li>\n<li>Restoring an imported mod list now works on large lists.</li>\n<li>Fixed reporting an update to the version you already have.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Listing fixes apply to mods installed from now on — reinstalling a mod through the app cleans up its existing entry.</p>\n",
