      "description": "<p>Release 0.4.0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mods now show their name, author and version - SPT 4.0 moved this data inside the mod’s DLL, and the manager now reads it from there.</li>\n<li>Update checking now finds mods reliably (matched by GUID) and no longer gets stuck.</li>\n<li>Fixed some mods showing nonsense as the author.</li>\n<li>Fixed multi-GB content mods failing to download or extract.</li>\n<li>The manager now tells you when a new version is released.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mods listed as Manual were installed outside the app, so they rely only on what their DLL exposes. Reinstalling them through the app fills in the missing author and version.</p>\n",
